  "details": "One person has been invisible and inaudible since the first time I met him. Apparently, he was in the same condition.\n When I first started VRchat, one of my friends I was playing with suddenly started talking to one person and I knew there was someone I couldn't see.\n I checked with my other friends and they said they could see and talk to the person without any problem.\n I checked my block list, but I didn't block him, and he said the same.\n I also checked social media and found that the person's name did not exist, and when I sent him a friend request from the web, he did not receive the request.",
